[111.342971, "o", "Final verification of Task sheet...\r\n\r\n1. Expression data cells (C11:L20) - checking first and last:\r\nC11: =IFERROR(INDEX(Data.$D$2:$BA$201,MATCH($A11,Data.$...\r\nL20: =IFERROR(INDEX(Data.$D$2:$BA$201,MATCH($A20,Data.$...\r\n\r\n2. Statistics cells (rows 24-27) - checking C24:L27:\r\nRow 24: =AVERAGE(C11:G11)\r\nRow 25: =STDEV(C11:G11)\r\nRow 26: =AVERAGE(H11:L11)\r\nRow 27: =STDEV(H11:L11)\r\n\r\n3. Fold change cells (rows 32-41) - checking first and last:\r\n"]
[111.343026, "o", "Row 32: A==A11, C==2^(C26-C24), D==C26-C24\r\nRow 41: A==A20, C==2^(L26-L24), D==L26-L24\r\n\r\n4. Checking sheet names:\r\nSheets: ['Task', 'Data']\r\n\r\n5. File info:\r\nFile path: /root/protein_expression.xlsx\r\nFile exists: True\r\n\r\n✓ All formulas have been added successfully!\r\n✓ The file is ready for use.\r\n\r\nTo verify calculations, open the file in Excel or LibreOffice Calc.\r\n"]
