[125.602559, "o", "FINAL COMPREHENSIVE VERIFICATION\r\n================================================================================\r\n\r\n1. TARGET PROTEINS (Column A, rows 11-20):\r\n   Row 11: sp|Q9HCY8|S10AE_HUMAN...\r\n   Row 12: sp|Q96EN8|MOCOS_HUMAN...\r\n   Row 13: sp|Q86UT8|CCD84_HUMAN...\r\n   Row 14: sp|O96000|NDUBA_HUMAN...\r\n"]
[125.602714, "o", "   Row 15: sp|Q86Y38|XYLT1_HUMAN...\r\n   Row 16: sp|Q5SZL2|CE85L_HUMAN...\r\n   Row 17: sp|Q9BQA1|MEP50_HUMAN...\r\n   Row 18: sp|Q9C0F1|CEP44_HUMAN...\r\n   Row 19: sp|Q9UH03|SEPT3_HUMAN...\r\n   Row 20: sp|P04632|CPNS1_HUMAN...\r\n\r\n2. SAMPLE CLASSIFICATION (Row 9):\r\n   Control samples: C9-G9\r\n   C9: Control\r\n   D9: Control\r\n   E9: Control\r\n   F9: Control\r\n   G9: Control\r\n   Treated samples: H9-L9\r\n"]
[125.602778, "o", "   H9: Treated\r\n   I9: Treated\r\n   J9: Treated\r\n   K9: Treated\r\n   L9: Treated\r\n\r\n3. EXPRESSION DATA FORMULAS (Sample: C11, D11, H11):\r\n   C11: =IFERROR(INDEX(Data.$D$2:$BA$201,MATCH($A11,Data.$A$2:$A$201...\r\n   D11: =IFERROR(INDEX(Data.$D$2:$BA$201,MATCH($A11,Data.$A$2:$A$201...\r\n   H11: =IFERROR(INDEX(Data.$D$2:$BA$201,MATCH($A11,Data.$A$2:$A$201...\r\n\r\n4. STATISTICS FORMULAS:\r\n   C24 (Control Mean): =AVERAGE(C11:G11)\r\n   C25 (Control StdDev): =STDEV(C11:G11)\r\n   C26 (Treated Mean): =AVERAGE(H11:L11)\r\n   C27 (Treated StdDev): =STDEV(H11:L11)\r\n\r\n5. FOLD CHANGE FORMULAS (Row 32):\r\n   A32 (Protein ID): =A11\r\n   B32 (Gene Symbol): =B11\r\n   C32 (Fold Change): =2^(C26-C24)\r\n   D32 (Log2 FC): =C26-C24\r\n\r\n6. LAST ROW CHECK (Row 41):\r\n   A41 (Protein ID): =A20\r\n   C41 (Fold Change): =2^(L26-L24)\r\n   D41 (Log2 FC): =L26-L24\r\n\r\n================================================================================\r\n✓ ALL REQUIRED FORMULAS ARE IN PLACE\r\n✓ TASK COMPLETED SUCCESSFULLY\r\n================================================================================\r\n"]
